### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Tejaswini", "email": "tej@example.com", "password": "Password123"}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "tej@example.com", "password": "Password123"}

### Create task  (replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Learn Spring Boot", "description": "Finish TaskFlow", "priority": "HIGH", "dueDate": "2026-10-20"}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?status=TODO&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Move status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1/status
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "IN_PROGRESS"}

### Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/summary
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
